# Conformance probe pack for absent-value sentinels in a UPER pack (spec 0.19
# ruling 22, spec 0.9). Public. A bit-length field takes `absent` as in any
# sequential bits pack; the UPER field after it is read at the cursor.
format        conformance-uper-absent
version       0.19.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          bits
layout        sequential
bit_order     msb
encoding      uper

field  probe.x  8         uint  absent 255
field  probe.n  int:0:7   uint
